# Allowlist: upload only what the deploy needs. Vercel does not read .gitignore,
# so without this the key in .env, raw data and videos would be uploaded.
/*
!api
!src
!web
!public
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!tsconfig.json
!tsconfig.build.json
!vercel.json
!data
data/*
!data/snapshots
data/snapshots/*
!data/snapshots/latest.sqlite
